# prefctl - Simple macOS preference CLI for plist editing
# Usage:
#   prefctl read domain [keypath]
#   prefctl write domain keypath type value
#   prefctl delete domain keypath

# Example for the below:
#
# Read a nested key:
#       prefctl read com.apple.symbolichotkeys AppleSymbolicHotKeys:64:enabled
#
# Write a new nested key:
#       prefctl write com.apple.finder FXPreferredViewStyle string Nlsv
#
# Delete a nested key:
#       prefctl delete com.apple.finder FXPreferredViewStyle

# WARN: We want to reduce maintenance, therefore, it is bad to maintain name
# mappings, instead we/one should learn to navigate the library/preferences
# dir instead.

